    "answer": "**The Marine Corps Hardship/Dependency Discharge Board convened on 27 August 1959 to consider Private First Class Lee H. Oswald’s case.**  \n\n- The board met at 1530 on 27 August 1959 to review Oswald’s dependency discharge request[1].  \n- A prior notice dated 26 August 1959 instructed that the board be convened “as soon as practicable” for Oswald’s case[2].",
